-- ROADCLUB · 0006 · badges reference data (77 badges). New badges: add rows in a new migration or via the admin panel (Phase 5).
-- Badges are data-driven: add rows (or edit criteria) without an app release. The badge engine (Phase 2)
-- interprets criteria.type; unknown types are ignored safely by older engines.
on conflict (id) do update set category = excluded.category, name_lt = excluded.name_lt, name_en = excluded.name_en,
  description_lt = excluded.description_lt, description_en = excluded.description_en, icon = excluded.icon, tier = excluded.tier,
  criteria = excluded.criteria, xp_reward = excluded.xp_reward, is_secret = excluded.is_secret, sort = excluded.sort;
